    "created_at": "2016-04-05T19:05:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-05T19:05:01Z",
    "body": "I think we would prefer that everything in the platform respect CORS. There are some historical exceptions grandfathered in (script, img, etc.) but we should not regress the same-origin policy for features that already support it correctly. In the end, if you want to use a cross-origin resource, it needs to expose CORS headers.\n",
